<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37606" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξόρμ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>urging on,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰ καλά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					3.9.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				19.1.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rushing forth,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύματος ἐπὶ τὴν γῆν</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.89
			</span></i>; <i>vehement attack,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ δι᾽ ὀλίγου ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					75.6
				</span></i>
			; <i>setting out, start,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκοθεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					1.11.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>cutaneous eruption,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).366
			</span></i> ( =
			<i><span class="en">
				9.138
			</span></i> Chart.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
